            "review_title": "Review at Bún Chả Sinh Từ",
            "review_text": "Vince C\n1 contribution\n0\nForeigners, be careful!! Not hygienic!!\nNov 2025 • Couples\nWe ordered and before we were served, we saw the waiters go to the back of the restaurant to swat bugs or flies with an electric swat off of the salad plates. There were so many. We didn’t believe what we just saw. Then the food was cold and the rolls seem to have been recooked. The bun cha was cold…We ate what we could in disgust not believing what had just happened, we did not touch the salad and once we got up to pay, they actually took our leftovers and put them back on the same table where they swatted the bugs so they could serve the same food to other customers (because we did not eat very much). We knew they would serve again because there were very few plates and we actually saw them take our plates from that exact table in the back of the restaurant when we ordered… This place does not seem to take hygiene very seriously. Be very careful!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten November 11, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
